{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "61b1fdb2b4f224c6d9abf7a5e736f3183e25e8040dae9d8d1267475166f86860", "ja": "勉強Chu→QUEST", "zh": "学习Chu→QUEST", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "24593c9f252b89a1c1f7dc9fc0c05f7dc5fe0514afa53a2221aeba4ca2ed3616", "ja": "リーダーとしての最初の仕事は、公演のセッ\nトリストを決めるお手伝い。メンバーへのリ\nサーチをこなす中で激励を受け、自信を持ち\n始めたふたりに、プロデューサーは公演のト\nップバッターをやってほしいと依頼する。", "zh": "队长的第一份工作，就是要协助排定\n公演的曲目表。两人在找其他成员\n做意见调查的同时，也受到了鼓励，\n自信油然而生，制作人则希望她们\n能够在公演中打头阵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9d48dfdcaf6726c5b72444783244be1db000f57e0454e6e16e5d4f34a9d6140e", "ja": "（地方公演に向けて、やる事は山積みだ。\nさあ、今日も一日はりきっていこう！）", "zh": "（地方公演的准备工作堆积如山呢。\n好，今天也要全力以赴！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "377fa31aac65f449eb456f81bec4bf9a41e72c940a299f90fa9cd52e858f6eff", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、\nおはようございますっ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，\n早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "5e7a02f7f84bb701eb82aaefe7b6f18c5dbce8295b35d59b5490b0e3fcfed225", "ja": "……おはよ、ございます。", "zh": "……早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b8dd188500f3e7c2f1ce344c20ff03f27f3a1db86151e12b38f7323cb2ce555d", "ja": "おはよう、百合子、杏奈。\nって、今日はずいぶん早いんだな？", "zh": "早安，百合子、杏奈。\n话说，你们今天怎么这么早？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "f81bdc5e180854fcdc85649045e42e0219da7c81185750c72d57369a83f4907a", "ja": "はい、今日は地方公演のメンバーで集まって、\n自主練をしようかなって。", "zh": "就是呢，今天我们地方公演的成员聚集起来，\n想说要不要来自主练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "64c2174cf4eca10abf59ffc42606adceca9e8627cfdbcadca05de56b8e65ad1e", "ja": "レッスンルームの、予約……\n取りに、きたの……。", "zh": "杏奈我们是来，预订……\n练习室的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b784a0567ba22676231cae46ed755f53af5b7f3b5bc7dcb32c2ea9f404827250", "ja": "そうだったのか。二人とも、\nちゃんとリーダーしてくれてるんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n你们两个很认真尽到队长的职责呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "ef5855fb57d9c460c3cb43c2a41f1b9a9f91d96dadd424d79939354cb770b799", "ja": "えへへ……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "ef5855fb57d9c460c3cb43c2a41f1b9a9f91d96dadd424d79939354cb770b799", "ja": "えへへ……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "f35e4470453ff870b10c3d042fcaa158e06f56392e36a08d31ab65ca13c58569", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんも、忙しそう……。\n何、してるの……？", "zh": "不过，{$P$}先生感觉也很忙……\n你在，做什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9db481561fc8a0a2fb723a04ff615bce0e5b81389c0175197fa328a8f2ccc370", "ja": "ああ、今は公演のセットリストを考えてたんだよ。\n……そうだ、二人はどんなのがいいと思う？", "zh": "哦，我刚刚正在想公演的曲目表。\n……对了，你们觉得怎么安排比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "7c2d2a6c40ae703a4bbced7dc1d962cf9f096cd70d49b5f3b4a0dd3388902674", "ja": "セットリストって……え？\n私たちだけの希望じゃなくて、全員分のですか？", "zh": "你说曲目表……咦？\n不只要排我们两个的，而是排所有成员的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "360d3e540cbff090cb87a33e3095c4d85fbf46d5ad3a81e4c8f1ca621146e6f6", "ja": "もちろん、全体の構成だからな。せっかくだから、\nリーダーの意見も聞かせてくれないか。", "zh": "当然，因为要安排整体演出。\n难得有这个机会，可以让我听听队长们的意见吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "db52ef0f45bb36653d7b4d7aa7a1b3f508f3fce07feace9dd56ae1950af89e79", "ja": "つまり……誰と誰が、一緒に出て……\nどんな曲を歌う、とか……？", "zh": "也就是说……谁跟谁，一起出场……\n要唱什么歌，之类的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "da31645bc8ffdc9bb2e2710624b0543a26d27d38cf8318491b88dbb7f18df4d3", "ja": "うう、自分のは想像したこともあったけど……\nみんなの分までは、考えたことないかも……。", "zh": "唔，虽然我有想像过自己的……\n不过好像没想过大家的部分吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "9f96ca91c714a51492b56f8481e3942a5522ee8b993e3b83d232fe3e4774a345", "ja": "あ……、{$P$}さん。\nみんなに、聞いてみても……いい？", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生。\n杏奈我们，可以去问……大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "f3262cdca3ef558026717e952adb9c41e72aab4de09f9b37047710fdfc9ad244", "ja": "あ、そっか！　どうせ自主練で会うもんね。\n杏奈ちゃん、それって名案かも♪", "zh": "啊，对耶！反正我们自主练习时会碰面嘛。\n小杏，这主意感觉不错喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4f9729a6691b119f56cb79a21ae74f0c84c24f0bf40f9b8153186628fec90d8a", "ja": "もちろん、いいよ。\n二人からみんなに聞いておいてくれるか？", "zh": "当然可以啊。\n你们要帮我先去问问大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "6b61c8b3a21c386ed51856e5c410ee0b25b2081d647b499a1636cb40adaf884e", "ja": "はい、任せてください！　行こう、杏奈ちゃん。\n最高のセトリを求めるクエストに！", "zh": "嗯，请交给我们！走吧，小杏。\n去解「追求完美曲目表」的任务！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "c7dc91ee087eaed59e06f0d6c1ca9e30c0d22c3d4a19229e4c3a8acec0a7fb0f", "ja": "セトリの希望ですか？　どなたと一緒になっても、\nありさには最高のゴホウビなんですけど……。", "zh": "希望曲目怎么安排？\n无论跟谁一起表演，对亚利沙都是最棒的奖励啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "6c572fb806546b814292638be31134eb2d092d3781ef64f46255416e8660e859", "ja": "育ちゃんと百合子ちゃんとはユニットでご一緒して\nますから、心もひとつだと思ってます！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "不过，毕竟亚利沙跟小育还有百合子有组过团体，\n我们也是心有灵犀吧！唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "1b48e4cfd7fae1923482177e4d74a200b30d4b1185275f7c760f080b3adc6de3", "ja": "ありがとう、亜利沙さん。\nわたしも、亜利沙さんと一緒だとうれしいな！", "zh": "谢谢你，亚利沙姊姊。\n我也想要跟亚利沙姊姊一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "6e64fd38c3a2ff5e13c769773460968ad4f352670b59e5e774505f2dbbb10acb", "ja": "ふおおおお！　ありさは幸せ者ですーっ！\nもう人生に悔いはありませんっ！！", "zh": "唔噢噢噢噢！亚利沙真的是太幸福了──！\n此生无憾了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "67d2b157e8ba4ac744687684014d245596812263d12d88b276822244e2b40801", "ja": "亜利沙、ちょっと……うるさい……。", "zh": "亚利沙，你……有点吵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "8471b80e915a7e3258afeb4141ec8465083b31c944523a19eb309deabbe5133c", "ja": "そっか～。育ちゃんはどうして、\n亜利沙さんと一緒がいいの？", "zh": "这样啊～\n小育为什么想跟亚利沙一起呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "1d4429bb64d5c975af46d12551751886ee864558cb7ede2ec62df509c05661cd", "ja": "えっとね、亜利沙さんっていつもおもしろいけど、\nステージでは、とってもキラキラしてるでしょ？", "zh": "这个嘛，亚利沙姊姊平常很有趣，\n在舞台上却又非常闪亮对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "b437986d55fe41ea64820f2f915a2119afa2d9caa6e912fdb8a7d8bc6eeb04f2", "ja": "わたしも、亜利沙さんみたいにキラキラしてる\nアイドルになりたいの。だからだよ！", "zh": "我也想跟亚利沙姊姊一样，\n成为一个闪闪发亮的偶像，这就是原因！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "63f6fc39fb08025420b0e31301b5de67f42c9cdc5b6874f9c2472f96249384de", "ja": "い、育ちゃ、育ちゃん……！　ほああああっ！", "zh": "小、小育、小育……！呜啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "11a433ffc34f7f6218d5f9f4375d9ff139d1a1b62e144a08e8754cc06bde43ab", "ja": "わかるなぁ。私も亜利沙さんのそういう所、\n憧れちゃってるから……♪", "zh": "我懂你的想法耶～\n因为我也很憧憬亚利沙的那种特质……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "86f96625ac27adbd6ac65233f6335b66d6be295fc35c25237234bcfe692cf293", "ja": "よーし、育ちゃんと亜利沙さんの希望は、\n私が大切に預かったよ。ありがとう！", "zh": "好──小育跟亚利沙的意见我郑重收下了。\n谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "217af55c2acc823d67e18af98a3b880400e4ee24310a5c3dfea05f7b32be2008", "ja": "どういたしまして！　公演のリーダー役、\n大変だと思うけどがんばってね、百合子さん！", "zh": "不客气！我想当公演的队长应该会很辛苦，\n但是你要加油喔，百合子姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "03d512f9a97fe6dd93bd97d7ae2204a295caed67162e4d789e7094b654992f43", "ja": "亜利沙……生きてる？", "zh": "亚利沙……你还活着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "51205fc5b458e5ed04599010d381997e14e6edb9a7501b9aa4776ecd3a3b4f67", "ja": "は、はひ……。ちょっとうれしすぎて、\n気を失いそうな……だけで……がくっ。", "zh": "呜、呜呜……亚利沙只是高兴到……\n差点晕过去而已……呃啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "91db97f336d2c4c4c886557510f782ebc35fbb96833a157b320c128c04bbf1a6", "ja": "ふむふむ、志保は、新鮮な曲、っと……。", "zh": "嗯嗯，志保希望歌曲能有新意啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "5f58e5dc80db1b93736b30c5a7ffd16f2055595d7d0cb863a217ee490ed082dc", "ja": "はい。歌いなれていない曲は、ちょっと不安ですけど。\n新鮮さも必要だと思いますから。", "zh": "是的，虽然还没唱熟的歌曲会让人有点不安，\n不过我认为新鲜感是不可或缺的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1035_045kar", "source_sha256": "6f30dbb2b8e3806d19ff11c1199f36f1553b211ed4b4606da33d00f7979158ab", "ja": "で、でも、二人とも大変だね。リーダーだからって、\nせ、セットリストまで考えるなんて……。", "zh": "话、话说，你们好辛苦啊。\n就算说是队长，竟然连曲、曲目表都要自己安排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "2a8074c96b55e14f3eaf7e278cfebe7bd0dcfbea900063cee5a567542f8d2649", "ja": "？　ど、どうしたの、杏奈ちゃん？", "zh": "嗯？怎、怎么了，杏奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "a3ee339903b6e3dcdd4afe6098c399ff2911f92754eeee41bbf91e95d82269f8", "ja": "可憐さん……ARRIVEのリーダー、だよね……。\nリーダーレベル、高そう……。", "zh": "可怜……是『ARRIVE』的队长，对吧……\n感觉队长等级……很高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1039_024ann", "source_sha256": "de957e10c954c04f866a54ed350c2754616a5cd77b449cdbe858e91bea8aaed7", "ja": "リーダーのコツ……\n教えてください、です……。", "zh": "请把当队长的诀窍……\n告诉我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1040_045kar", "source_sha256": "af334efbe7f7986318a719c52ca03abab4d9deaed9ae79a3815a7abb0242c81b", "ja": "えっ、こ、コツ……？　わ、私は、リーダーって\nいっても、みんなに支えてもらってただけで……。", "zh": "咦，诀、诀窍……？\n虽、虽说我是队长，但都只是靠大家的协助而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "ff4a91ce7ecc014a855842aa2f80c2b898365adf55e4615f41394f3a8a3d2fc0", "ja": "だから、リーダーレベルは、そんなに……\nた、高くないと、思うよ？", "zh": "所以，我的队长等级，应该……\n没、没有那么高喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1042_033sih", "source_sha256": "6b7f46b4891c9715f49a02938812fd2b196c096bcb2e3c7cf9b9e6b09fcc18e7", "ja": "……別に、リーダーシップを取るだけが\nリーダーじゃないんじゃないですか。", "zh": "……以当队长来说，\n看重的应该不只有领导力吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "7085036509e82aee7599df1897a42d8f0b564abc79fb4d96f3b8b3ffca38f680", "ja": "リーダーだからって、\n張り切りすぎるのもどうかと思いますし。", "zh": "而且我觉得，就算是队长，\n太过拚命也不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1044_033sih", "source_sha256": "2550ef2dd8f0ba0c9a4ac0fc229b0b5db5b4fe1f0557b533a16ef42417af4417", "ja": "私は、百合子さんと杏奈がリーダーなら、\n不満はありません。", "zh": "由百合子跟杏奈担任队长，\n我没有任何不满。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1045_045kar", "source_sha256": "07dcc05f37ddc5f8174ac2d1044867e841ac94f78a0db55851dd2341d45507e9", "ja": "私も、二人がリーダーって聞いて、嬉しかったから……\nやっぱり、いつも通りで、いいと思うな……♪", "zh": "我也一样，听到你们两个是队长时，真的很开心……\n所以我还是觉得，跟平常一样就好……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "fec35083cbb73d9e97ad9d21ad63f7da936b4541046603636ff7d681616bc5a4", "ja": "そうなんでしょうか……。えへへ、そうだといいな。\nふたりとも、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "真的是这样吗……嘿嘿，那就好。\n谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1047_024ann", "source_sha256": "85d5c0c39b98004c66a91c3ad630976691f0974a242b2b1fc1716fa8278de015", "ja": "ありがと……。\n杏奈、頑張り……ます♪", "zh": "谢谢……\n杏奈，会加油……的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1048_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1049_p", "source_sha256": "ccad3012fae29abb868f0e6423d029df05f037c8a1e958db8b963e79befe1482", "ja": "……よし！　やっとセトリが完成した。\n二人とも、リサーチありがとう。助かったよ。", "zh": "……好！曲目表终于完成了。\n谢谢你们协助做意见调查，帮了我一个大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1050_024ann", "source_sha256": "7b3babd1e33e30397474f1fed1c215d78167223868ff26404d45c897524ccdcb", "ja": "杏奈たち……{$P$}さんの、役に……\n立てた……？", "zh": "杏奈我们……有帮上……\n{$P$}先生的忙吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1051_p", "source_sha256": "2bd92f50f47faf302a5b40cccafa90af651eea5ca089e4d6bd4309f7305600ec", "ja": "もちろん。こんなにスムーズに決められたのは\nリーダーがしっかり者だからこそ、だな！", "zh": "那是当然，我之所以能够这么顺利地安排好，\n都是因为你们两位队长很可靠啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1052_024ann", "source_sha256": "ef5855fb57d9c460c3cb43c2a41f1b9a9f91d96dadd424d79939354cb770b799", "ja": "えへへ……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1053_026yur", "source_sha256": "ef5855fb57d9c460c3cb43c2a41f1b9a9f91d96dadd424d79939354cb770b799", "ja": "えへへ……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_02_1054_p", "source_sha256": "36767765126e396390fc08bb617ce6e314e3f70b2c6d5709d4ab92e159d47983", "ja": "というわけで、オープニングの全体曲が終った後、\n公演のメインプログラム1曲目も、二人に決まりだ。", "zh": "所以啊，开场的全体合唱曲结束后，\n公演的主要节目第一首歌，也决定交给你们两个了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
